# Data Modeling — Star Schema Design

## Overview

This document covers the data modeling phase of the **Enterprise Business Intelligence Analytics Implementation** project. The goal was to design a clean, performant star schema in Power BI that connects all data sources and enables efficient DAX calculations and time intelligence.

